# ADR required for architectural UI decisions

When a change introduces or changes any of the following, add or update a short ADR under `docs/adr/` (create the folder if missing) **in the same delivery**:

| Trigger | Examples |
|---------|----------|
| New side-action / pot type UI | Forms, tables, standings, reports |
| Client-side math mirroring backend | Projections, fund balance, game windows |
| Report architecture | Registry vs mega-modal |
| Identity key in UI maps | `user_id` only |
| Feature folder layout | New `src/features/side-actions/...` boundaries |

## ADR format (keep short)

1. Title + date  
2. Context (1 paragraph)  
3. Decision  
4. Consequences  
5. Backend ADR / capability row if paired  

Handoff markdown is **not** an ADR.
